    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Worlds is a roguelite platformer where you use the environment and creative abilities to overcome challenges. You'll need planning, wits and reflexes to make a way through these ever-changing death labyrinths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/25e312a96e730f2d4a85dea8a1ab4f83.poster.avif?t=1753334226\" width=616 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/25e312a96e730f2d4a85dea8a1ab4f83.webm?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/25e312a96e730f2d4a85dea8a1ab4f83.mp4?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game provides a free (lite) edition of Aura of Worlds, with a shorter campaign and shared progress.   <br><br>Explore strange biomes, escape flooding poison, outwit gargantuan bosses. Do you play defensively with a repeater and energy shield, or swing into the fray with a boomerang and grapple hook? Do you scour the levels for potions and runes; or dive headfirst into the chaos?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/3df08040ebd337b41324330f929679a3.poster.avif?t=1753334226\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/3df08040ebd337b41324330f929679a3.webm?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/3df08040ebd337b41324330f929679a3.mp4?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Along the way,  unlock starting gear options, shortcuts, character perks, pets, and more.\u00a0The friends you rescue on your journey will help you. Each procedurally generated run presents new hazards, layouts, and tactical decisions.\u00a0You can further customize your build with runes, and gear modifiers that synergize in a myriad of ways.  Veterans can push their limits by disabling perks or cranking up the difficulty for greater challenges\u2014and greater rewards.     </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features </strong> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/83f97f422da554611c42b1df083a6af4.poster.avif?t=1753334226\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/83f97f422da554611c42b1df083a6af4.webm?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/83f97f422da554611c42b1df083a6af4.mp4?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Level Themes</strong>: Tidal corridors lined with mines, flickering lights in underground ruins, rising lava pits, and carnivorous gardens. Each environment brings unique dangers and opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Abilities</strong>: Master parkour, cloak from enemies, or even enthrall foes to fight on your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Use Objects:</strong> Light your way with a lantern\u2014or throw it as an improvised flaming Molotov.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Fights:</strong> Outsmart colossal adversaries by using both your reflexes and the environment to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Pixel Art &amp; Animations: </strong>Beautifully detailed pixel visuals bring the world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Musical Score:</strong> An immersive soundtrack that evolves with your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong>: Unlock new items, character backgrounds, and more to customize your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more awaits\u2026 <br><br><br><i>Rogue Worlds is the free (lite) edition of Aura of Worlds, with a shorter campaign and shared progress.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Worlds is a roguelite platformer where you use the environment and creative abilities to overcome challenges. You'll need planning, wits and reflexes to make a way through these ever-changing death labyrinths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/25e312a96e730f2d4a85dea8a1ab4f83.poster.avif?t=1753334226\" width=616 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/25e312a96e730f2d4a85dea8a1ab4f83.webm?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/25e312a96e730f2d4a85dea8a1ab4f83.mp4?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game provides a free (lite) edition of Aura of Worlds, with a shorter campaign and shared progress.   <br><br>Explore strange biomes, escape flooding poison, outwit gargantuan bosses. Do you play defensively with a repeater and energy shield, or swing into the fray with a boomerang and grapple hook? Do you scour the levels for potions and runes; or dive headfirst into the chaos?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/3df08040ebd337b41324330f929679a3.poster.avif?t=1753334226\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/3df08040ebd337b41324330f929679a3.webm?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/3df08040ebd337b41324330f929679a3.mp4?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Along the way,  unlock starting gear options, shortcuts, character perks, pets, and more.\u00a0The friends you rescue on your journey will help you. Each procedurally generated run presents new hazards, layouts, and tactical decisions.\u00a0You can further customize your build with runes, and gear modifiers that synergize in a myriad of ways.  Veterans can push their limits by disabling perks or cranking up the difficulty for greater challenges\u2014and greater rewards.     </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features </strong> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/83f97f422da554611c42b1df083a6af4.poster.avif?t=1753334226\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/83f97f422da554611c42b1df083a6af4.webm?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410640/extras/83f97f422da554611c42b1df083a6af4.mp4?t=1753334226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Level Themes</strong>: Tidal corridors lined with mines, flickering lights in underground ruins, rising lava pits, and carnivorous gardens. Each environment brings unique dangers and opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Abilities</strong>: Master parkour, cloak from enemies, or even enthrall foes to fight on your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Use Objects:</strong> Light your way with a lantern\u2014or throw it as an improvised flaming Molotov.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Fights:</strong> Outsmart colossal adversaries by using both your reflexes and the environment to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted Pixel Art &amp; Animations: </strong>Beautifully detailed pixel visuals bring the world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Musical Score:</strong> An immersive soundtrack that evolves with your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong>: Unlock new items, character backgrounds, and more to customize your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more awaits\u2026 <br><br><br><i>Rogue Worlds is the free (lite) edition of Aura of Worlds, with a shorter campaign and shared progress.</i></p>",
